    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(DISCLAIMER!   Please contact me directly on the discord provided or steam discussions for bugs/Quality of life issues. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>O.A.S.I.S.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Wave-Based Zombie Survival Shooter Set in an Alternate 1980s Dystopia</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O.A.S.I.S.</strong> is a fast-paced, arcade-style zombie survival shooter set in a gritty, alternate 1980s world. Designed as a break from competitive multiplayer fatigue, this game lets you and up to 3 friends team up (or play solo) to fight off relentless waves of the un-dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each wave, the intensity rises\u2014zombies become faster, tougher, and more aggressive, pushing you to adapt your weapons, tactics, and teamwork to survive.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/859ec04754ed64966b144948ddb0dc98.poster.avif?t=1747175041\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/859ec04754ed64966b144948ddb0dc98.webm?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/859ec04754ed64966b144948ddb0dc98.mp4?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- <br><br>\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>What Makes O.A.S.I.S. Different?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Over-the-Top Action</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in <strong>airstrikes</strong> to wipe the horde.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in your own <strong>P.D.E.S.C. </strong>bot or Awaken the<strong> C.E.D.D\u00a0</strong> (Personal Defense &amp; Emotional Support Companion) (Controlled euthanization and\u00a0dismemberment Droid)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of ammo? Summon a <strong>Drop Pod</strong> to restock or bring heavy firepower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay That Respects Your Time</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No grinding.</strong> All weapons, perks, and items are available in-match\u2014earn them with skill or luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only progression system is a simple rank\u2014just for bragging rights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 More Than Just Survival</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>practical puzzles</strong> to unlock secret rooms, hidden weapons, and Easter eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to <strong>complete the level</strong> by defeating unique bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just play infinitely and see how long you can last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc64 All Characters Unlocked</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>4 distinct characters</strong>, each available from the start\u2014no unlock walls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/e7cd52668f44840ed4a7710f35f0ae51.poster.avif?t=1747175041\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/e7cd52668f44840ed4a7710f35f0ae51.webm?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/e7cd52668f44840ed4a7710f35f0ae51.mp4?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Airstrikes: Multiple airstrikes to use and find on the map!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/dbeeb238c615ea360df43954e7a50111.poster.avif?t=1747175041\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/dbeeb238c615ea360df43954e7a50111.webm?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/dbeeb238c615ea360df43954e7a50111.mp4?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Drop Pods: Call in drop pods to resupply, bring heavy ordinance, auto turrets and much more. Don't get caught un-prepared and empty handed against the horde.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/aba64a2239ec9558542855481eef4bcc.poster.avif?t=1747175041\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/aba64a2239ec9558542855481eef4bcc.webm?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/aba64a2239ec9558542855481eef4bcc.mp4?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Perks system: buy perks from different points around the map to gain special abilities. There are 6 perks at the moment and more will be added over time.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/285f490342c1f853c8024b454698e126.poster.avif?t=1747175041\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/285f490342c1f853c8024b454698e126.webm?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709600/extras/285f490342c1f853c8024b454698e126.mp4?t=1747175041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>- Traps are placed at various locations through out each map to help you tame the undead horde. Each trap is unique both visually and how they work. Some are devastating but quick, Others are meant to slow the horde down and help you make a quick getaway.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\ud83d\udd2b Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently 4  Maps</strong>: Death Valley, Last Resort, LockDown, and Bunker \u2013 with more on the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of Weapons &amp; Variants</strong>: Every base weapon has unique versions with custom attachments, sounds, and stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrades</strong>: Use the <strong>Munition Maximizer</strong> to turn basic guns into zombie-slaying beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Airstrikes &amp; Drop Pods</strong>: Tactical options that let you reshape the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong>: Each map includes unique traps\u2014some deadly, some tactical\u2014to help control the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perk System</strong>: 6 perks available (and more coming) to enhance your survivability and combat power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op or Solo</strong>: Play alone or team up online with up to 3 friends.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd12 No Paid DLC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All major updates, new maps, weapons, and content will be <strong>free</strong> for everyone who owns the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udd27 About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm a solo indie dev who works full-time as a mechanic. I built <strong>O.A.S.I.S.</strong> to be the kind of game I\u2019d want to play with my friends\u2014something fun, fast, and full of personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no grind. No complicated systems. No pressure. Just good, chaotic, zombie-blasting fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback matters\u2014I take all suggestions seriously and do my best to respond quickly (when my wife and daughter let me!). Updates might not always be lightning-fast, but I'm constantly working to improve the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out <strong>O.A.S.I.S.</strong><br>Join the <strong>Shadow Games Discord</strong> for news, suggestions, and community fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music by Karl Casey @whitebataudio on YouTube. </p>",
